msgstr "ຊື່ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ"

#. help text
#: src/include/crowbar/complex.rb:158
msgid "<p>Manage user names and passwords for Crowbar administrators.</p>"
msgstr "<p>ຈັດການຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ Crowbar.</p>"

#. textentry label
#: src/include/crowbar/complex.rb:194
msgid "&Mode"
msgstr "&ໂໝດ"

#. help text for the Network mode tab (do not translate bastion)
#: src/include/crowbar/complex.rb:196
msgid ""
"<p>Here, define a <b>Network Mode</b> with relevant <b>Bonding Policy</b>.</"
"p>\n"
"<p>You can also specify interface names for the bastion network conduits as "
"space-separated list.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດ <b>ໂໝດເຄືອຂ່າຍ</b> ພ້ອມກັບ <b>ນະໂຍບາຍການລວມກຸ່ມ</b> ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ.</p>\n"
"<p>ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລະບຸຊື່ຂອງອິນເຕີເຟສສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງເຄືອຂ່າຍ bastion ເປັນລາຍການທີ່ແຍກດ້ວຍຍະຫວ່າງ.</"
"p>"

#. textentry label
#: src/include/crowbar/complex.rb:206
msgid "Bonding &Policy"
msgstr "&ນະໂຍບາຍການລວມສາຍ"

#. textentry label
#: src/include/crowbar/complex.rb:215
msgid "P&hysical interfaces mapping for bastion network"
msgstr "ການຈັບຄູ່ອິນເຕີເຟດທາງ&ກາຍະພາບສຳລັບເຄືອຂ່າຍ bastion"

#. help text for conduit if list
#: src/include/crowbar/complex.rb:224
msgid ""
"<p>Each physical interface definition needs to fit the pattern\n"
"<tt>[Quantifier][Speed][Order]</tt>.\n"
"Valid examples are <tt>+1g2</tt>, <tt>10g1</tt> or <tt>?1g2</tt>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ການກຳນົດອິນເຕີເຟດທາງກາຍະພາບແຕ່ລະອັນຕ້ອງໃຫ້ຖືກຕາມຮູບແບບ\n"
"<tt>[Quantifier][Speed][Order]</tt>.\n"
"ຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງແມ່ນ <tt>+1g2</tt>, <tt>10g1</tt> ຫຼື <tt>?1g2</tt>.</p>"

